@QrPayment.WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5090

### Synthetic record creation only; no QR scan or money movement.
POST {{QrPayment.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Payment
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: synthetic-demo-001

{
  "merchantId": "fictional-merchant-001",
  "amount": 100,
  "orderId": "synthetic-order-001"
}

### Repeating the same key above returns 409; a missing key returns 400.
